WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
♫ I have a dream, a song to sing ♫

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.040
I'm so glad you're here.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:10.960
I'm pregnant.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.660
But, I don't know how to do this by myself.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.980
Your mother is the greatest person we ever met.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.740
Look at my baby.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.200
Let me tell you how she did it.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:23.820
All on her own.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.500
Life is short.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.200
The world is wide.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.820
I want to make some memories.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.860
This dress

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.280
might look very pretty on.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.440
Hey, you don't know me at all, do you?

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.300
I think we should stay here together.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.280
Oh, I wish I could stay here too.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.900
Turns out, he's engaged.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.080
I hate it when they do that.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.020
♫ I was cheated by you.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.840
♫ And I think you know when.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.080
♫ Look at me now.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.100
♫ Will I ever learn?

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:30.860
♫ I don't know how

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.500
♫ but I suddenly lose control.

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.900
♫ There's a fire within my soul

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.440
Come on girl

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.940
I've never felt closer to my mom.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.620
She wasn't scared.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.320
Because she had me.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.580
We can't tell anybody else about the baby, okay?

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.580
I just told Bill

00:01:58.580 --> 00:01:59.640
Yeah, and I told Harry

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.080
And I told many many people.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.780
Let's get the party started.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.760
Grandma, you are invited.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.900
That's the best kind of party, little girl.

